But I still have VEC_ELEMS multiply-adds per vector load. The total multiply-add count is the same (head_dim = num_d_vecs * VEC_ELEMS).

The main benefit is fewer load instructions and better memory throughput. This should improve performance for memory-bound cases.

Let me write the full optimized attention kernel now.

